ISO-10303-21;
/* Ad089: trailing comma in CARTESIAN_POINT coordinate list (1.0,2.0,3.0,); parser parameter-consumer falls off end of list, reads next entity's first byte as missing parameter; OCCT MANTIS#0031756; See also Ad088; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
